// from: UFOPUMP Cyberpunk.ts — 無盡摩天樓、窗格、霓虹招牌、電梯燈、飛船、探照燈、斜雨
void palette(float z, out half3 bg, out half3 c0, out half3 c1, out half3 c2, out half3 ac) {
  if (z < 0.5)      { bg = hx(0x12052a); c0 = hx(0x4a0f6a); c1 = hx(0xc81f9a); c2 = hx(0x3ff0ff); ac = hx(0xffe14a); }
  else if (z < 1.5) { bg = hx(0x04100f); c0 = hx(0x0d3a36); c1 = hx(0x1f8f7a); c2 = hx(0xffa23a); ac = hx(0xff3f8a); }
  else if (z < 2.5) { bg = hx(0x030a2c); c0 = hx(0x0f2a7a); c1 = hx(0x2f6fe8); c2 = hx(0xffe85a); ac = hx(0xff4fd8); }
  else if (z < 3.5) { bg = hx(0x1a0308); c0 = hx(0x5a0a1c); c1 = hx(0xd0283a); c2 = hx(0xe8f4ff); ac = hx(0x3ff0ff); }
  else              { bg = hx(0x03031c); c0 = hx(0x16185a); c1 = hx(0x4a5ae0); c2 = hx(0xa8f0ff); ac = hx(0xff8a3a); }
}

// 一層大樓：x 切成寬 slot 的欄位，每欄一棟寬度不同的樓；回傳 (是否在樓內, 樓內 x, 樓寬, 欄位編號)
float4 tower(float x, float slot, float minW, float maxW, float seed) {
  float id = floor(x / slot);
  float w = floor(minW + hash1(id * 3.1 + seed) * (maxW - minW + 1.0));
  float x0 = floor(hash1(id * 7.7 + seed) * (slot - w));
  float lx = x - id * slot - x0;
  return float4(lx >= 0.0 && lx < w ? 1.0 : 0.0, lx, w, id);
}

// 5×7 假字元（霓虹招牌用）：幾種筆畫隨機組合
bool glyph(float gi, float2 g) {
  bool on = false;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.1) > 0.5 && g.y == 0.0) on = true;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.2) > 0.5 && g.y == 3.0) on = true;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.3) > 0.6 && g.y == 6.0) on = true;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.4) > 0.5 && g.x == 0.0) on = true;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.5) > 0.5 && g.x == 2.0 && g.y > 1.0) on = true;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.6) > 0.5 && g.x == 4.0) on = true;
  if (hash1(gi + 0.7) > 0.6 && abs(g.x - g.y * 0.66) < 0.5) on = true;
  return on;
}

half4 main(float2 p) {
  float s = PX();
  float2 c = floor(p / s);
  float2 G = floor(size / s);
  float t = time * max(speed, 0.0);
  half3 bg; half3 c0; half3 c1; half3 c2; half3 ac;
  palette(zone, bg, c0, c1, c2, ac);

  // 天空：下方城市光害往上漸暗，加一條橫向流動的霧霾帶（1/4 解析度、5 階抖色）
  float2 q = floor(c / 4.0);
  float glow = pow(c.y / G.y, 1.3) * 0.95;
  float haze = 0.18 * smoothstep(0.12, 0.0, abs(c.y / G.y - 0.42 - 0.03 * sin(q.x * 0.2 + t * 0.4)));
  float sk = band(clamp(glow + haze, 0.0, 1.0), q, 5.0);
  half3 col = mix(bg, c0, sk * 1.4 > 1.0 ? 1.0 : sk * 1.4);
  if (sk > 0.7) col = mix(c0, c1, (sk - 0.7) * 1.2);

  // 探照光束：兩道很淡的光從下方緩慢掃過
  for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
    float fi = float(i);
    float2 base = float2(G.x * (0.3 + 0.4 * fi), G.y + 4.0);
    float ang = sin(t * (0.23 + 0.07 * fi) + fi * 2.0) * 0.5;
    float2 dir = float2(sin(ang), -cos(ang));
    float2 rel = c - base;
    float along = dot(rel, dir);
    float perp = abs(rel.x * dir.y - rel.y * dir.x);
    if (along > 0.0 && perp < 2.0 + along * 0.06 && dith(0.35 * (1.0 - along / G.y), c)) col = mix(col, c2, 0.18);
  }

  // 遠景：密集細瘦的樓，視差 0.2
  float fy = c.y - floor(t * 2.0);
  float4 f = tower(c.x, 9.0, 3.0, 6.0, 1.0);
  if (f.x > 0.0) {
    col = mix(bg, c0, 0.18);
    if (mod(f.y, 2.0) == 1.0 && mod(fy, 3.0) == 0.0 && hash3(float3(f.w, floor(f.y / 2.0), floor(fy / 3.0))) < 0.16) col = mix(c0, c1, 0.45);
  }

  // 飛船第 1 條航道（在中景後面）
  for (int i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
    float fi = float(i);
    float dirx = fi == 0.0 ? 1.0 : -1.0;
    float lane = G.y * (0.22 + 0.36 * fi);
    float sp = 14.0 + 6.0 * fi;
    float span = G.x + 80.0;
    float hx0 = mod(t * sp + fi * 57.0, span) - 40.0;
    float sx = dirx > 0.0 ? hx0 : G.x - hx0;
    float2 r = c - float2(floor(sx), floor(lane + sin(t * 0.8 + fi) * 2.0));
    if (r.y >= 0.0 && r.y < 2.0 && abs(r.x) < 3.0) col = r.y == 0.0 ? mix(c0, c1, 0.5) : c0;
    if (r.y == 1.0 && r.x * dirx < -3.0 && r.x * dirx > -22.0 && dith(1.0 + r.x * dirx / 22.0, c)) col = mix(col, c1, 0.6);
    if (r.y == 0.0 && r.x == 2.0 * dirx) col = ac;
  }

  // 中景：較寬的樓，左緣受光、右緣抖色收暗、樓層飾帶、窗格、霓虹招牌、電梯燈；視差 0.35
  float my = c.y - floor(t * 3.5);
  float4 m = tower(c.x + 7.0, 34.0, 10.0, 19.0, 2.0);
  if (m.x > 0.0) {
    float lx = m.y; float w = m.z; float id = m.w;
    col = mix(bg, c0, 0.45);
    if (lx < 1.0) col = mix(c0, c1, 0.5);
    if (lx > w - 3.0 && !dith((lx - (w - 3.0)) / 3.0, c)) col = mix(bg, c0, 0.4);
    if (mod(my + id * 13.0, 30.0) < 1.0) col = mix(c0, c1, 0.35);
    // 窗：常亮一組、慢慢明滅一組
    if (lx > 1.0 && lx < w - 2.0 && mod(lx, 3.0) != 0.0 && mod(my, 4.0) == 1.0) {
      float h = hash3(float3(id, floor(lx / 3.0), floor(my / 4.0)));
      if (h < 0.12) col = mix(c1, c2, 0.35);
      else if (h < 0.2 && sin(t * (0.5 + h * 3.0) + h * 40.0) > 0.2) col = mix(c1, ac, 0.4);
    }
    // 直立霓虹招牌：每棟樓一個，偶爾閃一下
    float blk = floor((my + id * 37.0) / 150.0);
    if (hash2(float2(id, blk)) < 0.4) {
      float sy0 = floor(hash2(float2(blk, id + 1.3)) * 100.0);
      float sl = mod(my + id * 37.0, 150.0) - sy0;
      float sxp = lx - 2.0;
      if (sxp >= 0.0 && sxp < 7.0 && sl >= 0.0 && sl < 34.0) {
        col = mix(bg, c0, 0.3);
        float2 g = float2(sxp - 1.0, mod(sl - 1.0, 8.0));
        float gi = floor(hash2(float2(id, blk)) * 40.0) + floor((sl - 1.0) / 8.0);
        bool flick = hash1(floor(t * 6.0) + id) > 0.97;
        if (g.x >= 0.0 && g.x < 5.0 && g.y < 7.0 && sl >= 1.0 && glyph(gi, g) && !flick) col = hash1(id + 4.0) < 0.5 ? ac : c2;
      }
    }
    // 電梯燈沿外牆上下
    if (lx == w - 4.0) {
      float ey = mod(floor(sin(t * 0.3 + id) * 40.0 + 60.0), 120.0);
      if (abs(mod(c.y, 120.0) - ey) < 1.0) col = c2;
    }
  }

  // 飛船第 2 條航道（在近景前），閃紅藍燈的巡邏機
  {
    float lane = G.y * 0.72;
    float hx0 = mod(t * 22.0, G.x + 100.0) - 50.0;
    float2 r = c - float2(floor(hx0), floor(lane + sin(t) * 1.5));
    if (r.y >= -1.0 && r.y < 2.0 && abs(r.x) < 5.0 && !(r.y == -1.0 && abs(r.x) > 2.0)) col = r.y < 1.0 ? mix(c0, c2, 0.3) : bg;
    if (r.y == -2.0 && r.x == 0.0) col = mod(floor(t * 2.0), 2.0) == 0.0 ? hx(0xff2a3a) : hx(0x3a7aff);
    if (abs(r.y) < 0.5 && r.x < -5.0 && r.x > -30.0 && dith(1.0 + r.x / 30.0, c)) col = mix(col, c2, 0.5);
  }

  // 近景：左右兩側各一棟貼著邊緣的暗樓，視差 0.5
  float ny = c.y - floor(t * 5.0);
  float edgeW = floor(max(10.0, G.x * 0.09));
  float nlx = c.x < edgeW ? edgeW - 1.0 - c.x : c.x > G.x - edgeW - 1.0 ? c.x - (G.x - edgeW) : -1.0;
  if (nlx >= 0.0) {
    col = mix(bg, half3(0.0), 0.35);
    if (nlx == 0.0) col = mix(bg, c0, 0.6);
    if (mod(ny, 40.0) < 2.0) col = mix(bg, c0, 0.4);
    if (nlx > 1.0 && mod(nlx, 3.0) == 0.0 && mod(ny, 5.0) == 2.0 && hash3(float3(c.x > G.x * 0.5 ? 9.0 : 3.0, nlx, floor(ny / 5.0))) < 0.25) col = mix(c1, ac, 0.3);
  }

  // 斜雨：一欄一欄的雨絲，每欄自己的速度和相位
  float u = c.x + floor(c.y * 0.35);
  float hcol = hash1(u * 1.7);
  if (hcol < 0.07) {
    float dy = mod(c.y + t * (55.0 + hcol * 120.0) + hcol * 300.0, 46.0 + hcol * 30.0);
    if (dy < 4.0) col = mix(col, c2, 0.25 + c.y / G.y * 0.2);
  }
  return half4(col, 1.0);
}
